#! ia 1.0

@contract scalar-template-runtime-contract
  version "0.1.0"
  meaning
    says "Scalar template rendering requires exact string parameters and returns a draft without writing an artifact."
    answers "What does render-template require and return, and how does it refuse a missing parameter?"
  relationships
    governs @operation render-template
  invariants
    REQ-SCALAR-TEMPLATE "For an admitted valid scalar template and valid substituted output, render-template accepts exactly the declared string parameters and returns one draft artifact without writing it; a missing declared parameter refuses with IA-EXEC-INPUT-INVALID."
